  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This refers to the ability to append tags to public avatars on publication. I tend to run Nanachi avatars a fair bit, and often am on the lookout for other players who also use an avatar of that character.  \n\nThis would extend the avatar search functionality to display users who have opted into the feature, and are using avatars containing the desired keyword (tag). The purpose of this would be to simplify the process of networking with these individuals, and greatly reduce the need to rely upon external communities for that purpose (such as Discord servers).\n\nAs mentioned above, I'm aware that Discord servers already serve this purpose for the most part. I do think it would be neat to see, though.\n\nThanks for listening!",
